# Tracked text is checked out with LF on every platform: Run manifests,
# the Workspace skill bundle and template-owned files are content-hashed, so a
# CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true) changes hashes and byte comparisons.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
